OL,3,GNEWSATheatre boss departs after 11
OL,4,Ayears as CEO
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe boss of the Curve Theatre in
OL,7,FLeicester is stepping down after more
OL,8,Fthan a decade in charge of the venue.
OL,10,FChris Stafford was appointed CEO in
OL,11,F2015, having previously served as
OL,12,Fexecutive producer alongside artistic
OL,13,Fdirector Nikolai Foster.
OL,15,FAudience attendance increased by 34%
OL,16,Fduring his tenure, according to the
OL,17,Ftheatre, along with learning and
OL,18,Fparticipation engagement by 62% and
OL,19,Fannual turnover by 156%.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
